#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/define_element_author.rst:5
msgid "Define author element information"
msgstr "定义元件作者信息"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/define_element_author.rst:8
msgid "Define author element information from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏定义元件作者信息"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/define_element_author.rst:10
msgid ""
"Select **Edit > Edit author information** menu item to display the `author "
"information PopUp window`_."
msgstr ""
"选择 **编辑 > 编辑作者信息** 菜单项，以显示 `作者信息弹出窗口 <author information PopUp window_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/define_element_author.rst:15
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element editor Edit Menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元件编辑器“编辑”菜单"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/define_element_author.rst:17
#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/define_element_author.rst:26
msgid "Introduce the desired information to the text box."
msgstr "在文本框中输入所需信息。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/define_element_author.rst:18
#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/define_element_author.rst:27
msgid ""
"Press the button **OK** to accept and close the `author information PopUp "
"window`_."
msgstr "点击 **OK** 按钮以确认并关闭 `作者信息弹出窗口 <author information PopUp window_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/define_element_author.rst:21
msgid "Define author element information using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用快捷键定义元件作者信息"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/define_element_author.rst:23
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech 支持使用快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/define_element_author.rst:25
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + y`` to display the `author information PopUp window`_."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + y`` 显示 `作者信息弹出窗口 <author information PopUp window_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/define_element_author.rst:31
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcut, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "有关 QElectroTech 快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
